-and-libraries":{"type":"topic","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"10min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"title":"Swift Package integration","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens":{"type":"topic","title":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","abstract":[],"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","role":"article"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"type":"topic","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"30min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"title":"Add more OUDS components","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme":{"type":"topic","title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","kind":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","estimatedTime":"15min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","role":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","kind":"article","abstract":[],"title":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/richer-and-more-original-components-of-ouds"},"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A radio picker and a checkbox item"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)":{"type":"topic","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","kind":"overview","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)","role":"overview"},"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift":{"fileType":"swift","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift","type":"file","content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"highlights":[{"line":7},{"line":10},{"line":11},{"line":12},{"line":13},{"line":14},{"line":15},{"line":16}],"fileName":"Content.swift","syntax":"swift"},"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item and a switch item","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png":{"alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item, a switch item and a link","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding":{"title":"Check Your Understanding","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check Your Understanding"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding","identifi